 from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 that same pair ran 26% of normal on the middle, and November to December 2025 ran 40%. Grid 25039 had its driest year in 1988 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
